# Jak 1, 0.1.8 (LIST-0.1.8 items 2 and 3; a tester: "jak froze collecting a snowing mountain power cell ... game is not
# frozen just jak daxter and the power cell"). Run with JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=training-start JAKVR_TEST_WARP=fuel-cell
# QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000 JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1: a new game, the continue to Geyser Rock, then Jak put a metre over its
# first power cell (frame 10000), which he takes. The cell first waits about 10 s on another camera already running
# as he lands there (the game's own "WARNING: fuel-cell stall" each frame; the same with the sound going on or
# stopped, and none in the tester's log), then its
# victory animation plays (streamed, on its sound stream, about 7 s; target-clone-anim). About a second into it the
# simulated headset takes the sound device away for 20 s ("audio_loss", the sound player's test aid). As 0.1.8:
# "[audio] the sound device has not asked for sound for 1 s ...", the device opened again every 3 s, the animation
# played to its end and Jak back in play, then "[audio] the sound device is playing again". With
# JAKVR_TEST_AUDIO_LOSS=old (the sound stopping with the device, as before 0.1.8): "[vr] the streamed animation
# fuel-cell-victory... held at N for 4 s (its sound stream stopped): it ends here", and Jak back in play.
